    "en": "ResearchWorld: all roles for E2E tasks (8 since HuTian v4.9, 9 on v4.8.2 and earlier); benchmark items take the roles of HuTian's own benchmark settings; the same model (Codex) in every role; provider —, reasoning effort high."
